    "多多随身作为节点 %@ 出现在你的 tailnet 里。退出后需要重新登录才能连上多多。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DuoDuo Pocket appears in your tailnet as the node %@. After logging out you need to log in again to reach DuoDuo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "多多随身通过你的 Tailscale 网络找到多多，不经过公网，也不用装 VPN。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DuoDuo Pocket reaches DuoDuo over your Tailscale network, never the public internet, and with no VPN to install."
          }
        }
      }
    },
