    "如果没有出现：长按 Passport 的 UP 键打开设置，选「重新配对」。以前配对过的，先在 iPhone 的「设置 › 蓝牙」里忽略这台设备。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not showing up? Hold UP on the Passport to open its settings and choose Re-pair. If it was paired before, first forget it in iPhone Settings › Bluetooth."
